### ==============================================================================
### SMARTRIS-PACS & SATUSEHAT REST API TEST COLLECTION (.http / REST Client)
### ==============================================================================
### File ini bisa langsung dijalankan dengan:
### 1. Ekstensi "REST Client" di VS Code / Cursor / Antigravity IDE (Klik 'Send Request')
### 2. Ekstensi "Thunder Client" atau import ke Bruno
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTENTIKASI: Login Admin / SIMRS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTENTIKASI: Cek Profil Pengguna Aktif
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. PASIEN: Buat / Sinkronisasi Pasien Baru (POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mrn": "RM-2026-TEST",
  "nik": "3171012345670001",
  "fullName": "Budi Santoso Uji SIMRS",
  "birthDate": "1985-07-15",
  "gender": "male",
  "address": "Jl. Merdeka No. 45, Jakarta Pusat",
  "phone": "081234567890"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. ORDER: Buat Order Pemeriksaan Radiologi Baru (POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sertakan satusehat_service_request_id jika SIMRS Anda sudah meng-generate ID SR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "modalityTypeCode": "CR",
  "bodyPart": "Thorax AP/PA",
  "clinicalNotes": "Batuk kronis 3 minggu, suspek TB / pneumonia",
  "priority": "ROUTINE",
  "accessionNumber": "ACC-20260929-TEST01",
  "satusehat_service_request_id": "SR-SIMRS-998811"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ORDER: Cek Status Detail Pemeriksaan (GET)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. SERVICE REQUEST: Update ID ServiceRequest secara Dinamis (PUT)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Digunakan jika nomor SR baru diterbitkan oleh SIMRS setelah order dibuat
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/satusehat/orders/1/service-request-id
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "satusehat_service_request_id": "SR-KEMENKES-STG-202609-001"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. EKSPERTISE: Simpan / Update Hasil Ekspertise Dokter Radiologi (POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/worklist/expertise/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "findings": "Cor dan pulmo dalam batas normal. Tidak tampak infiltrat aktif pada kedua lapang paru. Sinus kostofrenikus lancip.",
  "conclusion": "Cor dan Pulmo dalam batas normal (Normal Chest X-Ray).",
  "critical": false
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. EKSPERTISE: Tarik Hasil Bacaan / Ekspertise Dokter ke SIMRS (GET)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/worklist/expertise/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. EKSPERTISE: Hapus Hasil Ekspertise / Reset Draft (DELETE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/expertise
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. SATUSEHAT: Push Standalone ServiceRequest ke Kemenkes Sandbox (POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trigger pengiriman FHIR ServiceRequest mandiri dari SmartRIS ke SATUSEHAT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/satusehat/push-service-request/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. SATUSEHAT: Uji Koneksi Token OAuth2 Kemenkes Sandbox (POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/satusehat/test-connection
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. MASTER DOKTER: Hapus / Nonaktifkan Data Dokter (DELETE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contoh pengujian endpoint DELETE
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
